      "id": "be-s10-principal-agent-c2",
      "heading": "The fixes",
      "explanation_md": "**Owners and managers**\n\n- **Internal incentives**: incentive contracts, **stock options**, **year-end bonuses**.\n- **External incentives**: **personal reputation** and the **potential for takeover**.\n\n**Managers and workers**\n\n- **Profit sharing**\n- **Revenue sharing**\n- **Piece rates**\n- **Time clocks and spot checks**",
